          <div class="bar-chart">
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 50%"></div><span class="bar-val">620</span><span class="bar-year">19-20</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 55%"></div><span class="bar-val">680</span><span class="bar-year">20-21</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 60%"></div><span class="bar-val">750</span><span class="bar-year">21-22</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 68%"></div><span class="bar-val">840</span><span class="bar-year">22-23</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 74%"></div><span class="bar-val">920</span><span class="bar-year">23-24</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 85%"></div><span class="bar-val">1,050</span><span class="bar-year">24-25</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar" style="height: 93%"></div><span class="bar-val">1,150</span><span class="bar-year">25-26</span></div>
            <div class="bar-col"><div class="bar bar-current" style="height: 100%"></div><span class="bar-val">1,240</span><span class="bar-year">26-27</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="stage-note">Enrollment has grown from 620 to 1,240 students over seven academic years, an increase of 100 percent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

